      "content": "it's just hard to believe that things will actually get better. honestly, it feels less like i'm \"sick\" and more like i've just finished everything i was meant to do. like i've reached the end of my part in this. it feels so much more logical to just... stop trying to fix it, you know? like, why fight a battle that was lost a long time ago?",
